        {
            "block_label": "image",
            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_619_112_1128_263.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"41%\" />\n\nRM Generation Step\nPrior-driven generation under current Tx locations\n\nTx Update Step\nObservation-driven correction of Tx locations\n\nTx map  $ C_{t} $\nFrozen Prior\nBuilding clean RM  $ x_{0} $\n\nRefined Tx locations for next generation\n\nGenerated RM for consistency checking\n\nCompare  $ x_{0} $ with sparse observation\n\nTx update\n\n</div>\n",
